WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.518 line:84%
In Hindi, every noun is either masculine or feminine. Ladka is masculine, ladki is feminine.

00:00:07.518 --> 00:00:10.807 line:84%
Use hai for one, and hain for more than one.

00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:17.292 line:84%
Ladka is masculine, so we say achha. Ladki is feminine, so we say achhi.

00:00:18.292 --> 00:00:20.953 line:84%
Now say: This is a good book.
